1
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,030
(Supported by NRTA's Online Audiovisual
Quality Creation & Distribution Project)

2
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:29,530
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:35,360
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:39,750
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:44,040
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:48,580
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:52,730
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:58,360
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:03,170
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,530 --> 00:01:11,020
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,050 --> 00:01:14,080
=Episode 21=

12
00:01:19,840 --> 00:01:21,680
Yan! Yan!

13
00:01:21,959 --> 00:01:23,200
Come out, now!

14
00:01:24,159 --> 00:01:25,079
Yan!

15
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:27,640
Hurry and come out!

16
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,519
Help us, Yan!

17
00:01:30,959 --> 00:01:32,799
My son's barely hanging on!

18
00:01:32,959 --> 00:01:34,400
Come out, quickly!

19
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:36,640
Yan!

20
00:01:37,599 --> 00:01:38,239
What's wrong, ma'am?

21
00:01:38,319 --> 00:01:39,200
Yan,

22
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:42,480
my son's stomach hurts so badly.

23
00:01:42,799 --> 00:01:44,959
Do you still have that herbal medicine
from last time?

24
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,319
Give it to my son, now!

25
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:47,319
All right, wait a moment.

26
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:48,040
I'll go find it.

27
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:48,719
Hurry up!

28
00:01:48,799 --> 00:01:49,799
Mother, hurry.

29
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:50,879
I can't take it anymore.

30
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:54,040
It'll just be a moment.

31
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:55,879
Hurry up!

32
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:56,920
Mother.

33
00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:57,879
Hey, you there,

34
00:01:58,400 --> 00:02:00,200
could you at least be polite
when asking for help?

35
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:01,680
Hurry up!

36
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:03,519
- It's fine. She's just anxious.
- Stop dawdling!

37
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:06,400
Hurry up!

38
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,239
Something's off.

39
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:08,919
I think they can't see us.

40
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:14,080
Hurry up! Come on!

41
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:16,599
What's going on?

42
00:02:16,639 --> 00:02:17,879
Why isn't it ready yet?

43
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,199
This is probably your mother's memory.

44
00:02:19,599 --> 00:02:21,319
Maybe she doesn't want anyone
tampering with her memories.

45
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:22,479
Hurry up!

46
00:02:22,479 --> 00:02:23,479
Stop shouting!

47
00:02:24,039 --> 00:02:25,159
What's going on?

48
00:02:26,159 --> 00:02:27,000
You're a jinx!

49
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:28,360
Stay away from us!

50
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:29,960
Ma'am,

51
00:02:30,599 --> 00:02:31,719
I'm treating your son.

52
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,280
How can you speak of my wife like that?

53
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:35,719
What were you thinking,

54
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:37,240
marrying that jinx?

55
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:39,080
How dare you speak like that?

56
00:02:39,639 --> 00:02:40,919
You took our medicine

57
00:02:41,199 --> 00:02:42,120
and still insult us?

58
00:02:42,919 --> 00:02:44,719
Go home and keep an eye on your son.

59
00:02:44,879 --> 00:02:46,080
Keep him away from water.

60
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:48,800
You dare curse me?

61
00:02:49,039 --> 00:02:49,840
- Ma'am, ma'am!
- Mother!

62
00:02:49,919 --> 00:02:50,719
I'm missing one more herb.

63
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:52,199
Come on, I'll take you to find it.

64
00:02:52,319 --> 00:02:53,479
Come with me. Let's go.

65
00:02:53,759 --> 00:02:54,479
Hurry. Hurry.

66
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:55,800
Yaohua.

67
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:03,520
After I married Yan,

68
00:03:04,719 --> 00:03:06,919
the villagers drove us out.

69
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:08,800
We settled here.

70
00:03:09,919 --> 00:03:11,120
Yan has a kind heart.

71
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:13,759
Whenever he can, he goes to treat them

72
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:14,800
and gather herbs.

73
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:19,080
They gladly accept Yan's help,

74
00:03:19,639 --> 00:03:21,599
but avoid me like the plague.

75
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:23,560
Well, that's enough.

76
00:03:24,719 --> 00:03:25,479
Never mind.

77
00:03:27,479 --> 00:03:28,639
Are you afraid?

78
00:03:28,919 --> 00:03:30,039
Afraid of what?

79
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:32,439
You and Chu

80
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:33,639
took us in.

81
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:34,919
You're good people.

82
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,560
Why should we be afraid?

83
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:38,520
This world is full of fools

84
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,000
who believe whatever they hear.

85
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:42,080
Pay them no mind.

86
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:46,159
Just now, you told her

87
00:03:46,639 --> 00:03:47,800
to keep her son away from water.

88
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:49,599
Did you see something?

89
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:51,280
I saw...

90
00:03:51,879 --> 00:03:53,800
I saw that her son
would fall into the water.

91
00:03:57,039 --> 00:03:57,680
Yan.

92
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,039
Sorry about that.

93
00:04:00,159 --> 00:04:01,199
We woke you two up.

94
00:04:01,319 --> 00:04:02,159
Go back to sleep.

95
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:04,120
Yaohua, you go back too.

96
00:04:04,319 --> 00:04:05,240
Don't catch a chill in the wind.

97
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:06,960
Tomorrow

98
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:09,280
I'll go hunt some game for you all.

99
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:11,800
Come on, let's go.

100
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:25,279
Yaohua.

101
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:27,560
Li,

102
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:28,680
what's wrong?

103
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:31,360
Yan said

104
00:04:31,639 --> 00:04:33,399
he's going into the mountains to hunt.

105
00:04:33,839 --> 00:04:35,000
But I...

106
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:37,639
I keep feeling uneasy.

107
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:39,120
Don't worry.

108
00:04:39,399 --> 00:04:40,079
It'll be fine.

109
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:42,720
My child is about to be born.

110
00:04:43,319 --> 00:04:44,560
But these past days,

111
00:04:44,959 --> 00:04:46,639
I can't shake this uneasy feeling.

112
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:52,480
Thank goodness I have you with me.

113
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:55,480
Yaohua, I'm back!

114
00:04:56,319 --> 00:04:57,079
Yan.

115
00:04:58,720 --> 00:04:59,879
Why are you waiting out here again?

116
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:02,319
Careful you don't catch a chill
and get a headache again.

117
00:05:03,839 --> 00:05:05,600
I was worried about you.

118
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:07,560
Oh, right.

119
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,199
Look.

120
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:11,560
I went to town today

121
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:13,079
and traded the game I caught for this.

122
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:15,240
After our child is born,

123
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:17,360
let's give this to our baby as a gift.
How about that?

124
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:23,680
It's beautiful.

125
00:05:56,439 --> 00:05:57,079
Li,

126
00:05:57,639 --> 00:05:58,360
what's wrong?

127
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:00,199
Tomorrow

128
00:06:00,959 --> 00:06:02,399
is my birthday.

129
00:06:04,439 --> 00:06:05,480
That means

130
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:08,399
my father likely won't survive tonight.

131
00:06:11,439 --> 00:06:12,120
No.

132
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:14,199
I have to stop this.

133
00:06:15,879 --> 00:06:16,560
Li,

134
00:06:17,959 --> 00:06:19,160
this is your mother's memory,

135
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:20,560
not reality.

136
00:06:21,319 --> 00:06:22,319
You can't stop it.

137
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:25,079
But must I just watch him die?

138
00:06:27,439 --> 00:06:29,199
I've imagined countless times

139
00:06:30,519 --> 00:06:32,199
what kind of man my father was

140
00:06:33,079 --> 00:06:34,839
and why he died so young.

141
00:06:37,639 --> 00:06:39,480
Was he a terrible person?

142
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:41,519
Is that why heaven

143
00:06:41,839 --> 00:06:43,600
refused to keep him in this world?

144
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:46,000
But you've seen him.

145
00:06:46,839 --> 00:06:49,480
My father is so warm-hearted and kind.

146
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,639
Why did he have to die?

147
00:06:51,839 --> 00:06:53,279
Why did he die before he could even

148
00:06:53,279 --> 00:06:54,879
see his own daughter born?

149
00:06:54,959 --> 00:06:56,319
Why?

150
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:04,560
Li.

151
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:11,160
(Ziyuan,)

152
00:07:11,639 --> 00:07:12,240
(Li,)

153
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:13,360
(come out, quickly!)

154
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:19,639
Yan,

155
00:07:20,079 --> 00:07:21,040
- I'm not leaving!
- What's happening?

156
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:21,959
Ziyuan, Li,

157
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,319
take Yaohua and go first.

158
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:24,240
Get out of here.

159
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:25,879
Why should we leave?

160
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:27,040
I'm not leaving!

161
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:28,680
No matter what,

162
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:29,879
just get away for now.

163
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:31,399
What on earth is going on?

164
00:07:31,639 --> 00:07:32,519
I don't know either.

165
00:07:32,959 --> 00:07:33,920
She's carrying a child.

166
00:07:34,519 --> 00:07:35,879
You must take her away first.

167
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:38,079
Yan!

168
00:07:38,279 --> 00:07:38,800
Yan!

169
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:40,279
Come with us now.

170
00:07:41,439 --> 00:07:42,079
Li,

171
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:43,519
you two have nothing to do with this.

172
00:07:43,959 --> 00:07:45,079
Leave this place first.

173
00:07:46,319 --> 00:07:47,959
I can't leave Yan behind.

174
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:49,959
Leave right away. Go!

175
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:51,399
No.

176
00:07:51,639 --> 00:07:52,439
I'm going to save him!

177
00:07:53,199 --> 00:07:53,800
Li!

178
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:02,120
Everyone, listen to me first.

179
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:03,399
- Don't be rash, all right?
- Yan!

180
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:04,319
Yan!

181
00:08:04,319 --> 00:08:05,720
What are you doing here? Go back!

182
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:07,279
I can't leave you alone!

183
00:08:07,439 --> 00:08:08,560
What do you want?

184
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:10,560
You jinx!

185
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:12,800
How dare you put a death curse
on my son!

186
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:15,199
Yesterday, you told me
to keep him away from water.

187
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:17,879
And today, he drowned!

188
00:08:18,519 --> 00:08:19,439
It's on you!

189
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,800
What kind of sorcery did you use?

190
00:08:24,199 --> 00:08:25,040
It's a barrier.

191
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:27,000
Your mother's memory can't be altered.

192
00:08:27,199 --> 00:08:28,600
I warned you before,

193
00:08:29,079 --> 00:08:30,240
but you wouldn't listen.

194
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:32,159
Now you're blaming me?

195
00:08:32,559 --> 00:08:33,679
How is that fair?

196
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:35,879
Anyway, it's your fault!

197
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:38,480
You jinx! It's your fault my son died!

198
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:39,519
I'll make you

199
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:41,639
and the child in your belly
pay with your lives!

200
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:50,440
You're dead.

201
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:52,879
You're all going to die!

202
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:54,679
How dare she put a death curse on us!

203
00:08:54,799 --> 00:08:56,000
Beat them to death!

204
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,519
(Hit her! Do it!)

205
00:08:58,559 --> 00:08:59,919
No! No!

206
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,399
(Beat them to death! Kill that jinx!)

207
00:09:01,519 --> 00:09:03,320
- Stop it!
- (Beat them to death!)

208
00:09:06,039 --> 00:09:07,000
Yan!

209
00:09:07,919 --> 00:09:08,919
Stop hitting him!

210
00:09:09,399 --> 00:09:10,360
- Stop!
- Stop!

211
00:09:10,559 --> 00:09:12,120
Yan!

212
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:13,559
After all these years

213
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:15,559
of giving you herbs for free,

214
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:17,639
please spare my wife and child!

215
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:18,960
Don't listen to him!

216
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:21,360
Beat that witch to death, now!

217
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:24,000
No!

218
00:09:30,879 --> 00:09:31,639
Yan?

219
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:33,480
Yan!

220
00:09:36,759 --> 00:09:37,519
Father!

221
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:39,080
Father!

222
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:42,360
You...

223
00:09:45,919 --> 00:09:48,399
Yan! Yan!

224
00:09:48,919 --> 00:09:49,799
I can't

225
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:52,120
stay with you anymore.

226
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:58,200
Take care of the child.

227
00:10:04,039 --> 00:10:04,799
Father.

228
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:06,480
Father!

229
00:10:11,279 --> 00:10:12,200
Yan!

230
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,960
Yan!

231
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:20,679
We actually beat him to death. What now?

232
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,559
Then kill them all.

233
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:23,600
After that,

234
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:25,000
burn her body.

235
00:10:25,279 --> 00:10:26,159
No one will know.

236
00:10:28,279 --> 00:10:29,000
No!

237
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:30,919
Father!

238
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:32,480
Mother!

239
00:10:33,679 --> 00:10:34,799
Hurry! Beat them to death

240
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:36,639
before she gives birth
to another little jinx

241
00:10:36,879 --> 00:10:38,360
who'll bring us more misery! Hit her!

242
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:39,639
(Hit her!)

243
00:10:39,799 --> 00:10:40,399
(Hit her!)

244
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:14,679
I told you,

245
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:16,639
she's a demon.

246
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:17,879
Beat her to death!

247
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:18,759
Hit her!

248
00:11:20,879 --> 00:11:22,279
My husband and I

249
00:11:22,679 --> 00:11:24,720
have never harmed any of you.

250
00:11:25,399 --> 00:11:26,960
You ungrateful,

251
00:11:27,039 --> 00:11:28,559
foolish, petty wretches

252
00:11:29,279 --> 00:11:31,480
have brought us to this.

253
00:11:32,919 --> 00:11:33,799
You...

254
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:36,360
Which of you hasn't benefited

255
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:38,480
from Yan's kindness?

256
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:43,080
And yet you beat him to death.

257
00:11:47,279 --> 00:11:48,799
People like you

258
00:11:50,879 --> 00:11:53,559
have no right to live in this world.

259
00:12:07,159 --> 00:12:08,679
I'll kill you all.

260
00:12:09,519 --> 00:12:10,879
I'll kill you all.

261
00:12:11,440 --> 00:12:13,039
I'll kill you all!

262
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:14,279
Yaohua!

263
00:12:14,639 --> 00:12:16,120
Mother! Don't do it.

264
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:07,360
You've committed a grave sin.

265
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:08,159
Yes.

266
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:10,679
I killed them all.

267
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:16,200
Kill me too.

268
00:13:17,039 --> 00:13:18,360
You cannot die.

269
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:20,559
Because in your belly

270
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:23,159
lies the hope of Jinan City.

271
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:25,639
Jinan City?

272
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:27,240
Come to the Shaman Clan with me.

273
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:30,639
Spend your life atoning for your sins.

274
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:33,159
You have twenty deaths to answer for,

275
00:13:33,639 --> 00:13:34,840
while your daughter

276
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:39,039
will bear the fate
of Jinan City's 300,000 people.

277
00:13:39,559 --> 00:13:40,799
I only hope

278
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:44,159
my child can grow up healthy and safe.

279
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:45,080
I...

280
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:46,919
I don't want her

281
00:13:47,519 --> 00:13:50,159
to carry such a heavy burden
at such a young age.

282
00:13:51,799 --> 00:13:53,799
That is her fate.

283
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:02,320
(So...)

284
00:14:03,759 --> 00:14:05,480
(This is my fate.)

285
00:14:22,679 --> 00:14:23,440
Mother?

286
00:14:25,600 --> 00:14:26,320
Mother!

287
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:28,200
Li.

288
00:14:34,099 --> 00:14:40,849
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

289
00:14:41,259 --> 00:14:47,929
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

290
00:14:48,299 --> 00:14:51,619
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

291
00:14:51,789 --> 00:14:54,989
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

292
00:14:55,319 --> 00:15:01,979
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

293
00:15:02,399 --> 00:15:09,059
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

294
00:15:09,349 --> 00:15:15,709
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

295
00:15:15,879 --> 00:15:19,309
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

296
00:15:19,569 --> 00:15:22,789
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

297
00:15:22,829 --> 00:15:29,709
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

298
00:15:30,059 --> 00:15:33,589
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

299
00:15:33,749 --> 00:15:37,309
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

300
00:15:37,709 --> 00:15:44,149
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

301
00:16:13,059 --> 00:16:19,729
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

302
00:16:19,979 --> 00:16:26,269
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪
